### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Band vault without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/vault

### Band vault state (bandVaultPda / sppWeightsJson null until activated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/vault
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build create_band — only the chain_config owner wallet (403 for any other wallet)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/vault/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}

### Build create_band with a non-owner wallet must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/vault/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU"
}

### Confirm create_band without txSignature must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/vault/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "bandVaultPda": "BandVaultPda1111111111111111111111111111111"
}

### Build update_spp_weights before activation must be 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/vault/weights/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}
